From: E2631 port
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: zte: link the accel framework into the driver

zx279128s-accel.c is the acceleration-path framework (per-family mode
switch: stack/ffe/hw/zc, debugfs control, S0-S7 quiesce-drain-flush
switch protocol).  The Makefile of drivers/net/ethernet/zte/ is the one
file the target's files/ overlay does NOT own: it comes from the base
tree, and 033 already rewrote it to drop zx279128s-ppe.o.  So the new
object has to be added here, next to 033.

---
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/zte/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/zte/Makefile
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
 obj-$(CONFIG_ZX279128S_ETH) += zx279128s-eth.o
-zx279128s-eth-y := zx279128s-main.o zx279128s-switch.o
+zx279128s-eth-y := zx279128s-main.o zx279128s-accel.o zx279128s-switch.o
